        ],
        "korean": "正しくなくていいからさ\n優し過ぎる君のまま\n笑ってて欲しかっただけなのに それなのに",
        "romanization": "tadashiku naku te ī kara sa\nyasashi sugiru kimi no mama\nwaratte te hoshikatta dake na no ni sore na no ni",
        "english": "I don’t have to be right\nI just wanted you to stay the way you are\nKind hearted, always smiling, but",
